orry about it.\\nI’ll know if you are good or not by\\fbattling you right now.\\r","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00001":"Blue: No way!\\rHow the heck did I lose to you?\\r...\\rTch, all right...\\fHere, take this.\\fIt’s the Earth Badge.\\r","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00002":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\\nthe Earth Badge from Blue!","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00003":"Blue: With this Badge, you’ll be able\\nto use the HM move Rock Climb!\\fHere!\\rTake this as well!\\r","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00004":"Blue: It contains Trick Room!\\rIt allows slower Pokémon to move\\nbefore faster Pokémon for a while.\\rIt’s a very tricky move, isn’t it?\\nHence the name!","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00005":"Blue: ...\\rAll right, I was wrong. You’re the\\nreal deal.\\fYou are a good Trainer.\\rBut I’m going to beat you someday.\\nDon’t you forget it!","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00006":"Yo, legend in the making!\\rThe floor here is unstable,\\nso you should put away your Pokémon\\f...now!\\rThe Gym Leader is a guy who battled\\nthe Champion three years ago.\\rHe’s no pushover.\\nGive it everything you’ve got!","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00007":"Man, you are truly tough...\\rThat was such an inspirational battle.\\nIt brought tears to my eyes.","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00008":"Yo, legend in the making!\\rThe floor here is unstable,\\nso you should put away your Pokémon\\f...now!\\rThe Gym Leader is a guy who battled\\nthe Champion three years ago.\\rHe’s no pushover.\\nGive it everything you’ve got!\\r","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00009":"Viridian City Pokémon Gym","msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00010":"Viridian City Pokémon Gym\\rGym Leader: Blue\\nCertified Trainer!\\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T02GYM0101_002 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T02GYM0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T02GYM0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T02GYM0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T02GYM0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T02GYM0101_004":4,"obj_T02GYM0101_gsman3":0,"obj_T02GYM0101_gsman3_2":1,"obj_T02GYM0101_gswoman3":2,"obj_T02GYM0101_gswoman3_2":3,"